Package: surveychat
Title: Conversational Surveys with LLM Extraction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dylan", "Pieper", , "dylanpieper@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collect survey data in a chat. The user answers structured
    questions in a natural dialogue, and an LLM extracts and validates each
    answer, generates content, and asks adaptive questions. Answers are
    stored on any DBI backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dylanpieper/surveychat
BugReports: https://github.com/dylanpieper/surveychat/issues
